  headline: 'HII Regions: Giant Clouds of Ionized Hydrogen',
  description: 'Complete guide to HII regions — the largest and brightest emission nebulae in galaxies. Learn about ionization physics, Stromgren spheres, and famous examples like the Tarantula Nebula and Orion Nebula.',
  datePublished: '2026-02-17',
  dateModified: '2026-02-17',
  author: 'The Astronomy Space',
